{
  "id": "fluency-l4-putting-brackets-back",
  "course": "equations",
  "lesson": "l4-putting-brackets-back",
  "title": "Fluency: putting brackets back",
  "n": 20,
  "pass": 0.9,
  "minutes": 10,
  "families": [
    {
      "id": "common-factor",
      "skill": "take out a common factor",
      "vars": {
        "h": { "pick": [2, 3, 5, 7] },
        "p": { "int": [1, 6] },
        "q": { "int": [-9, 9], "not": [0] },
        "v": { "pick": ["x", "n", "y", "t", "m"] }
      },
      "let": { "hp": "h*p", "hq": "h*q" },
      "where": ["gcd(p, abs(q)) == 1", "p + q != 0"],
      "prompt": "Factorise ${poly(v; hp, hq)}$.",
      "widget": { "kind": "expression", "answer": "{h}({p:c}{v}{q:+})", "form": "factorised", "keyboard": "algebra" },
      "wrong": [
        { "id": "constant-not-divided", "tex": "{h}({p:c}{v}{hq:+})", "line": "Divide both terms by ${h}$: ${hq} \\div {h} = {q}$." },
        { "id": "letter-taken-out", "tex": "{h}{v}({p}{q:+})", "line": "Only ${hp}{v}$ contains ${v}$, so ${v}$ cannot come out of ${hq}$." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "The highest common factor of ${hp}{v}$ and ${hq}$ is ${h}$.",
        "${hp}{v} \\div {h} = {p:c}{v}$ and ${hq} \\div {h} = {q}$.",
        "So ${poly(v; hp, hq)} = {h}({p:c}{v}{q:+})$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "highest-common-factor",
      "skill": "factorise fully with the highest common factor",
      "vars": {
        "h": { "pick": [4, 6, 8, 9, 10, 12] },
        "p": { "int": [1, 5] },
        "q": { "int": [-7, 7], "not": [0] },
        "v": { "pick": ["x", "n", "y", "t", "m"] }
      },
      "let": { "hp": "h*p", "hq": "h*q" },
      "where": ["gcd(p, abs(q)) == 1", "p + q != 0"],
      "prompt": "Factorise ${poly(v; hp, hq)}$ fully.",
      "widget": { "kind": "expression", "answer": "{h}({p:c}{v}{q:+})", "form": "factorised-fully", "keyboard": "algebra" },
      "wrong": [
        { "id": "constant-not-divided", "tex": "{h}({p:c}{v}{hq:+})", "line": "Divide both terms by ${h}$: ${hq} \\div {h} = {q}$." },
        { "id": "letter-taken-out", "tex": "{h}{v}({p}{q:+})", "line": "Only ${hp}{v}$ contains ${v}$, so ${v}$ cannot come out of ${hq}$." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "The highest common factor of ${hp}{v}$ and ${hq}$ is ${h}$.",
        "${hp}{v} \\div {h} = {p:c}{v}$ and ${hq} \\div {h} = {q}$.",
        "So ${poly(v; hp, hq)} = {h}({p:c}{v}{q:+})$, and the bracket has no common factor left."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
